{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55594","headline":"赠华山陈希夷 · 范赞时","name":"赠华山陈希夷","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"□□□□□□□，□□□□□□□。\n曾逢毛女话何事，应见巨灵开此山。\n浓睡过春花满地，静林中夜月当关。\n纷纷诏下忽东去，空使蒲轮倦往还。\n（《过庭录》。\n）（按：《过庭录》云此诗爲「文正祖唐公」作，北宋时曾刻石，首联缺。\n《宋诗纪事》卷五误以作者姓名爲范唐公。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"范赞时","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55594.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55594","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}